<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 2 firms raise Sun Micro.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 2 firms raise Sun Micro.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst John Jones raised his rating on Sun Microsystems Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- also Morgan Stanley analyst Steven Milunovich upgraded the stock to strong buy from outperform, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Milunovich also raised his earnings estimate to $1.85 per share from $1.68 for 1997, and introduced a 1998 estimate of $2.10, according to the source.</p>
</text>
